WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.375 --> 00:00:04.877
(Luwin): Robert Baratheon's victory
at the Trident

00:00:04.878 --> 00:00:08.589
was a turning point
in the war for the Iron Throne.

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:11.842
While it was clear the gods
were smiling on the rebel forces,

00:00:11.843 --> 00:00:16.221
Aerys Targaryen still held
the Red Keep at King's Landing.

00:00:16.222 --> 00:00:19.308
As Robert was wounded and unable to ride,

00:00:19.309 --> 00:00:22.895
it was up to Eddard Stark
to make for the capital

00:00:22.896 --> 00:00:26.899
and force the Mad King
to give up the throne.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.651
Lord Stark reached the city gates

00:00:29.652 --> 00:00:33.614
to find that Tywin Lannister,
Lord of Casterly Rock,

00:00:33.615 --> 00:00:36.909
had already sacked the city
in Robert's name.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:39.912
House Lannister had remained neutral
up to this point,

00:00:39.913 --> 00:00:44.249
ignoring requests for help
from both the crown and the rebels.

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.586
Now that Robert's eventual victory
was assured,

00:00:47.587 --> 00:00:52.424
it seemed Lord Tywin
had finally chosen a side.

00:00:52.425 --> 00:00:56.428
Lord Eddard was horrified by
what he saw when he entered the city -

00:00:56.429 --> 00:00:58.931
homes looted and burned,
women raped,

00:00:58.932 --> 00:01:01.808
scores of innocent citizens killed.

00:01:01.809 --> 00:01:05.896
Disgusted, he led his force
up Visenya's hill to the Red Keep.

00:01:05.897 --> 00:01:07.940
Upon entering the throne room,

00:01:07.941 --> 00:01:11.568
he found King Aerys
lying in a pool of blood...

00:01:11.569 --> 00:01:15.322
dead, by the hand of
his own sworn Kingsguard,

00:01:15.323 --> 00:01:17.032
Jaime Lannister,

00:01:17.033 --> 00:01:21.370
who sat brazenly upon the throne.

00:01:21.371 --> 00:01:24.790
Demanding to know
the whereabouts of Queen Rhaella,

00:01:24.791 --> 00:01:28.835
Lord Eddard was informed
the queen and her son Viserys

00:01:28.836 --> 00:01:32.756
had been spirited away to Dragonstone
before the Lannisters arrived.

00:01:32.757 --> 00:01:36.718
But other members of the royal family
were not as fortunate.

00:01:36.719 --> 00:01:40.472
Elia Martell of Dorne,
who was the wife of Prince Rhaegar,

00:01:40.473 --> 00:01:43.976
had been raped and murdered
by Ser Gregor Clegane

00:01:43.977 --> 00:01:46.436
on Lord Tywin's orders.

00:01:46.437 --> 00:01:50.649
Ser Gregor and his men had also
butchered Rhaegar's young children.

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:53.610
When Robert was well enough
to reach the capital,

00:01:53.611 --> 00:01:58.282
Lord Eddard demanded the Lannisters
answer for their heinous crimes.

00:01:58.283 --> 00:02:00.242
Robert refused,

00:02:00.243 --> 00:02:04.663
and sent himself to relieve
the Baratheon stronghold of Storm's End,

00:02:04.664 --> 00:02:08.792
which was still under siege
by forces loyal to the crown.

00:02:08.793 --> 00:02:13.130
Whatever words passed between
the two old friends are known only to them,

00:02:13.131 --> 00:02:17.843
but Lord Eddard is said
to have left King's Landing in anger.

00:02:17.844 --> 00:02:19.928
Later, when Robert was crowned,

00:02:19.929 --> 00:02:23.056
he appointed Jon Arryn
as Hand of the King.

00:02:23.057 --> 00:02:25.350
Lord Arryn's first order of business

00:02:25.351 --> 00:02:28.353
was to broker a truce
with the Martells of Dorne,

00:02:28.354 --> 00:02:30.314
who were outraged by the brutal murder

00:02:30.315 --> 00:02:33.108
of Princess Elia and her children.

00:02:33.109 --> 00:02:35.527
Following the death of Lyanna Stark,

00:02:35.528 --> 00:02:37.613
who had been betrothed to Robert,

00:02:37.614 --> 00:02:41.241
Houses Baratheon and Lannister
were joined in marriage

00:02:41.242 --> 00:02:45.078
when the new king took
Tywin Lannister's eldest daughter, Cersei,

00:02:45.079 --> 00:02:46.830
as his queen.

00:02:46.831 --> 00:02:51.831
As for Eddard Stark, he returned
to his stronghold of Winterfell,

00:02:52.045 --> 00:02:54.921
forever haunted by his sister's death,

00:02:54.922 --> 00:02:59.922
and the shameful way
that Robert had secured his throne.

